      "title": "Resources and Encounters",
      "subtitle": "Useful things to know",
      "icon": {
        "id": "gateways:gate_pearl"
      },
      "description": [
        "The Farming for Blockheads Market sells Menril, Coffee, Canola, Hemp, and Demon's Dream starters. Use sieves, rituals, and the encounter recipes shown in JEI for resources and mobs that a void world cannot generate. Boss drops still require their encounters; there is no terrain Overworld or adventure dimension."
